__________________________________________
__ Capítulo 1 - Upgrade Zabbix from 5.0 LTS(5.0.46) to 6.0 LTS(6.0.40)
__
------------
0) Check de version support:
https://www.zabbix.com/documentation/6.0/en/manual/installation/upgrade_notes_600
--
To complete successful Zabbix server upgrade on MySQL and MariaDB
mysql> SET GLOBAL log_bin_trust_function_creators = 1;
Once the upgrade has been successfully completed, log_bin_trust_function_creators can be disabled:
mysql> SET GLOBAL log_bin_trust_function_creators = 0;
--
1)Databse version required
The minimum required MariaDB version has been raised from 10.3.x to 10.5.X
--
---------------------------------
-- ANTES DE INICIAR ATUALIZAÇÃO -
--
--  SNAPSHOT  --
1) Backup do Server ZABBIX01:
1.1) Acesse o ESX1:
https://ESX1/
1.2) Localize a VM ZABBIX01;
1.3) Acesse a opção:
ACTIONS > Snapshots > Manage snapshots
1.4) Clique em "TAKE SNAPSHOT..." e depois em "CREATE";
--
--  ALERTAS  --
2) Desativar mídias de alerta:
2.1) Acesse o Zabbix:
https://192.168.1.10/
2.2) Acesse a opção:
Administration > Media types
2.3) Desative as mídias:
- Email (HTML)
2.4) Acesse a opção:
Administration > Actions
2.5) Desative as Triggers:
- Email Trigger
___
__________________________________________
Step 1: Stop Zabbix Server
--
systemctl stop zabbix-server
systemctl stop zabbix-agent
___
__________________________________________
Step 2: Backup Zabbix componentes 
back up your data and copy all relevant Zabbix files to your backup directory
--
2.1 Backup directories
--
mkdir -p /opt/zabbix_backup/bin_files /opt/zabbix_backup/conf_files /opt/zabbix_backup/doc_files
mkdir -p /opt/zabbix_backup/web_files /opt/zabbix_backup/db_files
--
2.2 Backup Zabbix binary, conf and doc files
--
cp -rp /usr/sbin/zabbix_server /opt/zabbix_backup/bin_files
cp -rp /etc/alternatives/zabbix-server /opt/zabbix_backup/bin_files
cp -rp /usr/sbin/zabbix_server_mysql /opt/zabbix_backup/bin_files
cp -rp /etc/zabbix/zabbix_server.conf /opt/zabbix_backup/conf_files
cp -rp /etc/httpd/conf.d/zabbix.conf /opt/zabbix_backup/conf_files 2>/dev/null
cp -rp /etc/php-fpm.conf /opt/zabbix_backup/conf_files 2>/dev/null
cp -rp /usr/share/doc/zabbix-* /opt/zabbix_backup/doc_files
--
2.3 Backup Zabbix web files (frontend)
cp -rp /usr/share/zabbix/ /opt/zabbix_backup/web_files
--
2.4 Backup Zabbix database ( base muito grande, se precisar usaremos do snapshot  )
--mysqldump -h localhost -u'root' -p'rootDBpass' --single-transaction 'zabbix' | gzip > /opt/zabbix_backup/db_files/zabbix_backup.sql.gz
___
__________________________________________
Step 3: Setting Upgrade Version to 6.0 LTS
--
-- 6.0 LTS
-- rpm -Uvh https://repo.zabbix.com/zabbix/6.0/rhel/8/x86_64/zabbix-release-6.0-4.el8.noarch.rpm
--
3.1 Executar a atualização:
rpm -Uvh https://repo.zabbix.com/zabbix/6.0/rhel/8/x86_64/zabbix-release-6.0-4.el8.noarch.rpm
--
3.2 Limpar objetos obsoletos do cache de instalação
dnf clean all
--
3.3 Atualizar a lista de objetos de instalação
dnf update
___
__________________________________________
Step 4: Upgrade zabbix version and grafana
--
4.1 Upgrade zabbix-agent
dnf upgrade zabbix-agent
--
4.2 Upgrade zabbix-apache-conf
dnf upgrade zabbix-apache-conf
--
4.3 Upgrade zabbix-server-mysql
dnf upgrade zabbix-server-mysql
--
4.4 Upgrade zabbix-get
dnf upgrade zabbix-get
--
4.5 Upgrade grafana
dnf upgrade grafana
___
__________________________________________
Step 5: Upgrade database and enable log_bin_trust_function_creators
--
5.1 Verificar versões de MariaDB disponiveis:
yum module list mariadb
--
5.2 Apontar para o MariaDB versão 10.5:
dnf module switch-to mariadb:10.5
--
5.3 Habilite log_bin_trust_function_creators pra atualizar tabela histórico:
-- mysql -u root -p
mysql> SET GLOBAL log_bin_trust_function_creators = 1;
___
__________________________
Step 6: Start Zabbix service and database upgrade
--
6.1
 systemctl start zabbix-server
--
6.2 Check Database Upgrade process: 
 tail -f /var/log/zabbix/zabbix_server.log | grep database
Ex:--------------
 33275:20250527:131320.093 starting automatic database upgrade
 33275:20250527:131320.102 completed 0% of database upgrade
...
 33275:20250527:131348.236 completed 100% of database upgrade
 33275:20250527:131348.236 database upgrade fully completed
 33275:20250527:131348.265 database could be upgraded to use primary keys in history tables
--
6.2 Check Table History Upgrade process: 
 tail -f /var/log/zabbix/zabbix_server.log | grep 'history data'
Ex:--------------
33865:20250527:131728.284 syncing history data in progress...
33868:20250527:131728.291 syncing history data... 100.000000%
33868:20250527:131728.291 syncing history data done
___
__________________________
Step 7: Reboot the server
--
7.1 Verificar se a aplicação subiu e logar na interface WEB com as credenciais de domínio.
systemctl status zabbix-server
--
7.2 Se não logar, logar com usuário Admin, com a senha de "ADM"
___
__________________________
Step 8: Confira os Dashboards e Históricos antes de avançar para o próximo upgrade.(Capítulo 2)
--
